{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40704","headline":"春日隐居官舍感怀 · 李洞","name":"春日隐居官舍感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风吹烧烬杂汀沙，还似青溪旧寄家。\n入户竹生牀下叶，隔窗莲谢镜中花。\n苔房毳客论三学，雪岭巢禽看两衙。\n销得人间无限事，江亭月白诵南华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}